表情：以前の探索者とNPCは日常の一コマを描いたように自然な笑顔で、現在の探索者は悲しみを秘めつつ決意を顕にしている感じでお願い致します。\n希望ポーズ：お任せ致します。\n\n以上となります！ 何卒よろしくお願いいたします！\n\nhttps://www.dropbox.com/sh/fz0dq3ffnhctjym/AADYRD9Hl63W3ht7nmPvf0QVa?dl=0", "nc": 1, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@Moz_Moz__/works/7", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 1351517, "client_id": 984769, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/73fd6cc3/uploads/origins/04b75aee-4c8d-449a-90ae-9e759a196302?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9392e1af4e38518396f1ff0c517a10e3", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/73fd6cc3/uploads/origins/04b75aee-4c8d-449a-90ae-9e759a196302?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9392e1af4e38518396f1ff0c517a10e3, https://si.imgix.net/73fd6cc3/uploads/origins/04b75aee-4c8d-449a-90ae-9e759a196302?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8fec0f1f5d6d2def23e2d1b20a6bd933 2x, https://si.imgix.net/73fd6cc3/uploads/origins/04b75aee-4c8d-449a-90ae-9e759a196302?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d5df238759973611b827b6f81f30e3be 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/73fd6cc3/uploads/origins/04b75aee-4c8d-449a-90ae-9e759a196302?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=2854b9d8e206a60f934007bcbc111f16", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/73fd6cc3/uploads/origins/04b75aee-4c8d-449a-90ae-9e759a196302?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=2854b9d8e206a60f934007bcbc111f16, https://si.imgix.net/73fd6cc3/uploads/origins/04b75aee-4c8d-449a-90ae-9e759a196302?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=09b04f9a0b42695e8f5242f8d303f34e 2x, 